# The ways the Monuments window closes (see monuwin.scene for how it is opened): from the list, Return, Escape, a letter, a digit,
# Space, Tab and an arrow key close it (every key does: the window has no keys of its own); a click on nothing leaves it open;
# a key while a monument is zoomed goes back to the list instead (and a second one closes it). The window is opened again for
# each, with the records given again (the kind shown is kept with them).
25 load
42 state mon 0x94ca08 0x2780
42 state work 0x7fa96c 0x44
42 state count 0x7fd634 4
42 state parse 0x9bb570 0xa84
44 open mon_14a
46 open monument_list
52 click 20 20
55 snap click-nothing
57 key Return
62 snap closed-return
64 open monument_list
70 key Escape
75 snap closed-escape
77 open monument_list
83 key a
88 snap closed-letter
90 open monument_list
96 key 5
